        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.117,
            0.883,
            0.183
          ],
          "content": "**1. For each number given below, write expressions for at least two different ways to obtain the number through button clicks. Think like Chitti and be creative.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.192,
            0.635,
            0.212
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** Some ways are given below. Try more ways."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.215,
            0.499,
            0.287
          ],
          "content": "**(a) 8300 Ans:** (8 × 1000) + (3 × 100) or, (5 × 1000) + (33 × 100)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.296,
            0.259,
            0.314
          ],
          "content": "**(b) 40629**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
