            0.395
          ],
          "content": "**(c) 56354**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.457,
            0.81,
            0.531
          ],
          "content": "**(d)66666 Ans:** (66 × 1000) + (6 × 100) + (66 × 1) or, (6 × 10000) + (6 × 1000) + (6 × 100) + (6 × 10) + (6 × 1)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
